    "reviews": [
      {
        "name": "places/ChIJ8VIazvEBBDQRYdVfluSwBpo/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21KeGFWbGxNVkJDWVV0T01HcG9ZVjlCYzFaVWJGRRAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "6 個月前",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": {
          "text": "是的，他們有素食麵包，旁邊還有普通麵包。漢堡真的很好吃，紅薯條也超讚！還配了蒜蓉醬！給我點餐的那位女士超級友善！而且上菜速度也很快！",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "Yes , they do have a veggie bun. And a regular bun next to it. Really enjoyed the burger and the sweet potato fries is killer! Came with the garlic sauce! The lady who took my order was super friendly !!!! The order was quick as well!!!",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
        "authorAttribution": {
          "displayName": "Jun Kung",
          "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106948269876792684461/reviews",
          "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWTOp-ZYm7OhwkiZ591deJL3n4Avb7Iy26MBXNuDm7Xjmav13o=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3"
        },
        "publishTime": "2026-04-05T16:16:17.537186340Z",
        "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21KeGFWbGxNVkJDWVV0T01HcG9ZVjlCYzFaVWJGRRAB&d=17924085&t=1&wv=1",
        "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21KeGFWbGxNVkJDWVV0T01HcG9ZVjlCYzFaVWJGRRAB!2m1!1s0x340401f1ce1a52f1:0x9a06b0e4965fd561"
      },
      {
        "name": "places/ChIJ8VIazvEBBDQRYdVfluSwBpo/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21KVVNrUXdWVzlCWkRkUmJYUmFaVUU1WHpsNmNHYxAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "6 個月前",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": {
          "text": "晚點到的，辦理完入住手續就出去吃點東西。\n\n大概十點半，老闆本來打算關門了，但還是熱情地讓我進去了。\n\n坐下後，點了餐，我們聊了會兒天。\n\n漢堡、薯條、兩品脫啤酒和三杯烈酒下肚後，我結帳回家，心情非常滿足。\n\n老闆安迪非常健談，也很熱情。\n\n如果你在城裡，絕對值得一去。\n\n食物美味，價格合理。\n\n謝謝哥們兒。",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "Landed late, checked in and popped out for some food.\nAbout 10.30om, dude had plans of closing but happily let me in.\nSat, ordered and we chatted.\nBurger, chips, 2 pints and 3 shots later I settled up and dawdled home, very content.\nAndy the owner was very chatty and obliging.\nDef worth a visit if you are in town\nFood delicious and well priced.\nThanks mate.",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
        "authorAttribution": {
          "displayName": "aaron huffam",
          "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114979853968090857475/reviews",
          "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI8AiBReisZ3_usnRNR8bLrBlZ_Szn_7wzoYSmblkllTMf3xS4=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3"
        },
        "publishTime": "2026-04-10T05:19:07.401084878Z",
        "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21KVVNrUXdWVzlCWkRkUmJYUmFaVUU1WHpsNmNHYxAB&d=17924085&t=1&wv=1",
        "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21KVVNrUXdWVzlCWkRkUmJYUmFaVUU1WHpsNmNHYxAB!2m1!1s0x340401f1ce1a52f1:0x9a06b0e4965fd561"
