        "rating": 5,
        "text": {
          "text": "食物絕對美味，是我在泰國吃過最好吃的漢堡。員工非常友好，強烈推薦！",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "Food was absolutely delicious best burgers in Thailand. Staff is extremely friendly, cannot recommend enough!",
